Right, well then, you two are in special seats... We're watching!

89
00:16:55,044 --> 00:17:02,544
頑張ってね！だって思いのほか特等席なんだもん！
Do your best! Because it's surprisingly a special seat!

90
00:17:02,544 --> 00:17:07,544
そう、みんな後ろに椅子があるんですけど…特等席で我々見ておりますので！
Yes, there are chairs in the back for everyone... so we are watching from special seats!

91
00:17:07,844 --> 00:17:11,044
ねね頑張って！がんばるぞー！
Nene, do your best! Let's do our best!

92
